r severity. But we need to make a contribution now. Since no prior discussion, we can start by presenting an initial recommendation, perhaps Candidate B, with justification, and note concerns to be discussed.\n\nThus public message: I recommend Candidate B, because of conscientiousness, stress handling, weather assessment, but note concerns about memory and remarks. Suggest we probe further.\n\nWe must include metadata vote.\n\nProceed."}
